**Programming & Environments:**

- Python (Pandas, NumPy, NetworkX, rdflib)
- Jupyter Notebooks

**Databases & Graph Technologies:**

- Neo4j (Cypher Query Language, Neo4j Admin)
- Knowledge Graphs & Semantic Networks
- Ontologies (OWL, RDF)

**Core Concepts:**

- Knowledge Representation and Reasoning (KRR)
- LLM Prompt Engineering and Evaluation (Context-Augmented vs. Zero-Shot)
- Graph Modeling and Traversal Algorithms
- Semantic Querying and Path Finding

