## 🚀 Getting Started

Each project is contained within its own dedicated directory. Please navigate to the specific project folder and refer to its individual `README.md` file for detailed instructions on installation, execution, and data structures.

Generally, you will need a Python environment with the standard data science and graph libraries installed:

```bash
# Recommended environment setup
python -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install pandas numpy networkx rdflib jupyter